| Action | Command / Code | Rationale |
|--------|----------------|-----------|
| **Add `.env` to `.gitignore`** | `echo ".env" >> .gitignore` | Prevents plaintext commit. |
| **Remove direct `dotenv` call from `app.js`** | See the `config/secrets.js` wrapper above. | Centralises secret loading and makes swapping providers trivial. |
