| 7 | **Content‑Security‑Policy (CSP) tuning** for any HTML you serve. | Mitigates XSS. |
| 8 | **Do not log sensitive data** (passwords, JWTs). | Avoids credential leakage. |
| 9 | **Regularly rotate secrets** (`JWT_SECRET`, DB passwords). | Limits impact of secret compromise. |
|10 | **Health‑check endpoint should be protected** (e.g., only internal IPs or use a secret token). | Prevents enumeration of service status by attackers. |

